The protocol, parsing, TOTP, formats, jobs, cache, security, upstream and
anonymous visit modules are retained under vendor/reauth_web. Imports use
the local package namespace. Local changes validate conversion input,
release protocol sessions, redact job errors and stop workers on shutdown.
Redemption handles malformed inventory replies, exports only available
accounts and serializes downloads to reuse cached exports. Conversion and
regression tests use the local package namespace.
Accounts within one reauthentication batch use the bounded worker pool.
K12 supplies its own routes, lifecycle, configuration and frontend.
